-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Moments of silence.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Moments_of_silence..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212051303\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Moments of silence.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Moments_of_silence..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212051303\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Moments_of_silence..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212051303 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Moments_of_silence..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212051303 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Moments of silence.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Moments_of_silence..png\" data-image-name=\"Moments of silence..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_10\" title=\"Series 10\">10</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\">Richard Herring</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legit_glass.\" title=\"Legit glass.\">Legit glass.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Air_Horn_Andy.\" title=\"Air Horn Andy.\">Air Horn Andy.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Moments of silence.</b></i> is the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_10\" title=\"Series 10\">Series 10</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 3 December 2020. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\">Richard Herring</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Moments_of_silence.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"A couple of moments of silence\" were called for by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> after all of the contestants disappointed him in the <a href=\"/wiki/Fill_this_cup_so_that_it_overfloweth\" title=\"Fill this cup so that it overfloweth\">Fill this cup so that it overfloweth</a> task. The title card shows a close-up of a typewriter. It's likely this is just an aesthetic photo taken by the crew that doesn't relate to any task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Moments_of_silence.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Stille øjeblikke', which translates as 'Silent moments'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hiljaisia hetkiä', which translates as 'Silent moments'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Mordgåta med manusminnesförlust', which translates as 'Murder mystery with script amnesia'. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Learn_your_lines\" title=\"Learn your lines\">Learn your lines</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Et øyeblikks stillhet', which translates as 'A moment of silence'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Moments_of_silence.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Daisy_May_Cooper\" title=\"Daisy May Cooper\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Daisy May Cooper</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Johnny_Vegas\" title=\"Johnny Vegas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Johnny Vegas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Parkinson\" title=\"Katherine Parkinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katherine Parkinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mawaan_Rizwan\" title=\"Mawaan Rizwan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mawaan Rizwan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Richard Herring</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_with_wings\" title=\"Best thing with wings\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing with wings.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fill_this_cup_so_that_it_overfloweth\" title=\"Fill this cup so that it overfloweth\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Fill this cup so that it overfloweth. The cup must remain atop the cup pole at all times. Only liquids may touch the red green.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Learn_your_lines\" title=\"Learn your lines\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Learn your lines.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Drink_one_full_tablespoon_of_coconut_water\" title=\"Drink one full tablespoon of coconut water\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Drink one full tablespoon of coconut water. If you use the same coconut water extraction method as another contestant, you will be disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stare_at_your_opponent_without_blinking\" title=\"Stare at your opponent without blinking\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Stare at your opponent without blinking. You must both be pulling the face that the Taskmaster chooses.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">18\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Moments_of_silence.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/moments-silence\"><i>Moments of silence.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70911-008\"><i>Moments of silence.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141505\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.118 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.171 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 598/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25735/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argum